    rdamd:P30137 "\"Edited with an introduction and notes by Thomas D. Clareson\" on title page and jacket. Each story is followed by Clareson's \"Notes\".\nOn copyright page: \"First Edition\", \"Copyright (c) 1972\" and LCCN.\nGutter code \"N29\" on page 311 indicates printed late July 1972. Assume publication in September.\nThere is no ISBN on book or jacket of this first printing. Later printings use ISBN 0-385-01657-3.\n$5.95 price on jacket front flap. \"Jacket by Robert Aulicino\" on back flap." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
