    rdamd:P30137 "This listing is for Scribner's US edition, which was also printed by Faber & Faber in the UK. Both versions have chartreuse cloth boards with gilt titles on spine, and the same jacket art.\nOn copyright page: \"Printed in Great Britain\", \"Copyright under the Berne Convention\", LCCN and US ISBN.\n\"Jacket illustration by Dave Griffiths\" and $8.95 price on jacket front flap.\n\"SCRIBNERS\" at bottom of spine on book and jacket. Jacket back flap has US ISBN, \"Printed in Great Britain\" and blurb for Priest's novel \"The Perfect Lover\".\nPublication month from Locus." ;
