    rdamd:P30137 "• \"First published 1976\"\n• Printing not stated, no number line\n• Published to commemorate the 33rd World Science Fiction Convention held in Melbourne, August 1975.\n• \"Jacket design by Michael Payne\" on copyright page, no visible signature on the artwork [wraparound]\n• There is no price printed on the jacket/book; there is what appears to be a publisher's sticker on the front flap, source for the price\n• Le Guin is entered without the middle initial in the TOC, but with it on the story's title page\n• Dick is misspelled as Phillip, throughout\n• Aldiss is without the \"W.\" throughout." ;
