    rdamd:P30137 "On copyright page: \"First Edition\" (as noted by Currey), \"Copyright (c) 1966 by Damon Knight\" and LCCN.\nDoubleday printing code \"G50\" on page 252 indicates printed early December 1965. Assume published in February 1966.\n$4.50 price on front jacket flap. \"Jacket illustration by John Rombola\" on back flap.\nPages preceding page 1 are not numbered. The \"Contents\" page says Knight's Introduction is on page \"ix\". By that count, there are 12 pages preceding page 1." ;
