    rdamd:P30137 "Cover art credited on back flap of dustjacket.\n\"This edition first published in 1985\" on copyright page.\nLocus lists a January, 1986 publication date with a $9.98 price and notes that it is an \"instant remainder\" book.\nPages [793]-[797] are blank.\nPages [798]-[800] are \"ACKNOWLEDGMENTS\" listing sources for the included material.\nCopyright page lists Jennifer Rhys as editor. Title page and dustjacket list Edward L. Ferman.\nNo BLIC.\nNo LCCN (from LOC lookup)." ;
