    rdamd:P30137 "\"July 1976\"\nFirst printing by number line 1—10\nThe artist is not credited, the artwork is plainly signed\nOnly one section, III, is without a titled essay for the section. Two stories have essays titled the same as the story, but many stories do NOT have individual essays directly relevant to them. The essays are relevant to the subject essays, not always to the stories. The Section III title header is without page number in ToC, all others have them.\nNew York A.D. 2660 is NOT listed as an excerpt, but \"as part of the novel Ralph 124C41\"\nPrinted in the US" ;
