    rdamd:P30137 "#9\n\"Editors: John Clute, Alan Dorey, Colin Greenland, Simon Ounsley and David Pringle. Art Editor: Ian Miller.\" is stated on p. 2, which serves also as contents page.\nAlso stated: \"Designer: Abigail Frost. Assistant Editors: Paul Annis and Andy Robertson.\".\nNo statement for a publisher to be found.\nThe internal pieces by Kadrey all have their individual titles and are subsumed under the heading \"Synaptic Intrigue\".\nThe nonfiction items beginning on and following after p. 45 are subsumed under the heading \"The Outer Zone\".\nPp. 16, 36, 44, 51 and 52 are ad pages.\nOther price: $2.50.\nISSN 0264-3596." ;
