    rdamd:P30117 "edited by John Clute ; Alan Dorey ; Colin Greenland ; Roz Kaveney ; Simon Ounsley ; David Pringle ; Ian Miller" ;
    rdamd:P30011 "1984-03" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "40 p." ;
    rdamd:P30137 "#7\n\"Editors: John Clute, Alan Dorey, Colin Greenland, Roz Kaveney, Simon Ounsley and David Pringle. Art Editor: Ian Miller.\" is stated on p. 2, which serves also as contents page.\nAlso stated: \"Published quarterly\", \"Designer: Abigail Frost. Assistant Editor: Andy Robertson.\" & \"ISSN 0264-3596\".\nNo statement for a publisher to be found.\nThe reviews are only credited to (DP), (JC) or (CG), respectively.\nThe interior illustrations for the pieces of shortfiction are credited on p. 2.\nPp. 38-40 are ad pages.\nOther price: $2.50." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
