    rdamd:P30137 "Stated first edition (\"Originalausgabe\" on the title page and on the back, \"Originalausgabe 12/2001\" on the copyright page).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 2001 to the publisher.\nEditor on behalf of the publisher: Friedel Wahren.\nStated first printing (\"01\" on the back next to the ISBN).\n\"Printed in Germany 2001\" is stated on the copyright page.\nThe pieces of shortfiction are grouped in five sections, from which the titles for the respective introductory essays were taken, each with its own title page.\nThe table of contents appears on pp. 5-7.\nThe final piece of shortfiction ends on p. 408.\nDetailed sources for the individual items begin on p. 409, the last page of this (p. 414) is unnumbered.\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design is credited to Nele Schütz Design.\nOther price: €7.00 (valid from 2002 on)." ;
