        "LCCN 73-87699" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"First American printing, 1974\" stated on the copyright page.\nThe copyright page contains the Library of Congress Cataloging in Publication Data (omitting the ISBN) including the LCCN (73-87699).\nThe ISBN is printed only on the back flap of the dustjacket, not within the book itself.\n\"Jacket design by Paul Bacon\" printed on the back flap of the dustjacket.\nMonth of publication from Locus #167, November 20 1974." ;
