        "OCLC/WorldCat 23200416",
        "Reginald-3 17301" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Revised, expanded, annotated, illustrated edition.\nOversized format (28 cm tall).\nPublished and edited by V. Vale and Andrea Juno.\nPaperback edition notes on copyright page: \"Limited edition of 300 autographed hardbacks: ISBN 0-940642-19-0\"\nNo month of publication is stated. Month given here taken from Locus1.\nThe last page of text is 127, followed by 8 pages of the Re/Search catalog, with one more full-page photograph by Ana Barrado which should be considered part of the collection (a cropped version of this photograph appears on the back cover.)\nThe stories are listed and numbered as chapters, 1-15." ;
