    rdamd:P30137 "\"Berkley Medallion Edition, December, 1972\"\nPrinting not stated, no number line.\nEach story is preceded by a Leo & Diane Dillon image and an Introduction by Harlan Ellison, and followed by an Afterword by the story's author\nThe artist is not credited, V.DiFate is on the artwork\nInterior art is uncredited and unsigned. Credit from the Doubleday/SFBC edition\nISBN derived from 9 digit SBN (from copyright page) 425-02274-9.\nFirst paperback edition of the entire hardcover collection. Berkley had previously released three separate partial editions.\nPrinted in the US" ;
