    rdamd:P30137 "• \"This revised,expanded, annotated edition first published in Great Britain by Flamingo in 1993\"\n• Month from Locus1\n• The artist is not credited, no visible signature\n• Drops two stories: Queen Elizabeth's Rhinoplasty and The Secret History of World War 3 and the interior illustrations.\n• The two extra stories added in the 1990 Re/Search edition are placed in an Appendix\n• $14.95 in Australia; $19.95 in New Zealand; $13.95 in Canada\n• The title in the image looks black but is actually bright gold, an effect from the scan" ;
