    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 0839823398",
        "OCLC/WorldCat 2137279" ;
    rdamd:P30106 "The Gregg Press Science Fiction Series" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"First Printing, June 1976\" on copyright page.\nNo dust jacket, as issued. Green buckram with titles in gold on red background.\nNo printed price. Price from Gregg Press catalog.\nPhotographic reprint of the 1974 Anchor Press paperback edition.\nEach introduction is separately paginated in roman numerals. The Clareson introduction is new to the Gregg Press edition. The Spinrad introduction appeared in the Anchor Press edition as well.\nThe book is divided into several sections, each with a prefatory essay by Spinrad. The page numbers for the essays that appear below are the pages on which the essays actually begin rather than the ones in the table of contents which reflect an additional page for a false title and a blank page." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
