    rdamd:P30137 "Whole Issue No. 8. Cover art consists of what appears to be a segment of a NASA photo of a rocket or a satellite (in fact it's from Amazing June 1964). There are two cartoons inside the front end cover. The bottom one (\"It says we should travel and meet new people\")is signed by \"Frosty\". The top one is not signed, but is assumed to be by Frosty as well based on the style. The illustration on page 84-85 is not credited, but signed \"Llewellyn\".\nMonth of publication is estimated." ;
