    rdamd:P30011 "1973-11-15" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "68 p." ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"Andrew Porter Editor & Publisher\"; \"Richard Lupoff Book Editor\"; \"Ted White Contributing Editor\".\nISSN 0002-5364.\n'Doompublication #363'.\nDate of publication from statement in the copyright section.\nFull wraparound cover.\nP. 3 features the table of contents and the art credits.\nAll interior art is black & white.\n\"Beyond Mars\" is a reprint of a Jack Williamson penned comic strip.\nThere are numerous ads; pp. 2, 11, 13, 15, 21, 25, 34 & 35, 38, 45, 47, 53, 59 and 67 are pure ad pages." ;
