    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 0002258471" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"Published by Flamingo 2000\" stated on the copyright page (p. iv) with a complete number line: \"1 3 5 7 9 8 6 4 2\".\nTitle page shows the publisher as \"Flamingo (over) An Imprint of HarperCollinsPublishers\".\nISBN on copyright page, back flap and on the back of the dustjacket over the barcode.\nThere are eight unpaginated pages preceding the novel which begins on p. 1. These pages are notated here with i-viii.\nContents on pp. v & vi.\n\"Cover illustration based on photograph © Attard Photolibrary\" printed on back flap of the dustjacket.\nFeatures a photo of the author credited to Jerry Bauer on back flap of the dustjacket.\nPrice is printed at the bottom of front flap of the dustjacket." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
