        "OCLC/WorldCat 1131209306",
        "Reginald-3 20774" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First edition\nSFBC ID# 14784 and it is found on the book's lower back cover.\nNo ISBN number found anywhere in or on the book. According to OCLC, there is a printing with ISBN 1-56865-039-6, which may have been an earlier or later printing than the verified copy.\nKathryn Cramer is listed as assistant editor, who also translated \"The Mouse Festival\".\nThe J. M. Barrie excerpts are from his novel The Little White Bird.\nAnthology is broken down into five separate parts. Part One: Enchantments (1-136), Part Two: Wonders (p 137-243), Part Three: Creatures (p 244-364), Part Four: Worlds (p 365-500) and Part Five: Adventures (p 501-656)." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
