    rdamd:P30137 "Publisher stated as 'North East London Polytechnic on behalf of the Science Fiction Foundation' on the copyright page.\nISSN 0306-4964\nNo price for an individual copy stated - only for a subscription of three numbers, which was £5.00 in the UK & Europe and $12.00 in the USA (prices for institutions were higher).\nPage numbering starts on the first interior (third) page. The last numbered page is 108, an ad page, which is followed by the inside back cover and the back cover.\nThe two reviews by George Hay are part of his essay.\n!!! At least in the primary verifier's copy pp. 58 & 59 are blank: the end of George Turner's essay and the beginning of the one by Gregory Feeley are missing (not the case for PV2's copy, nor in the supplied weblink)." ;
