    rdamd:P30137 "\"Otto racconti \" is an original Italian anthology. Contains:\nBefore Eden translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Prima dell'Eden\"\nBillennium translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Per piccina che tu sia\"\nSummertime on Icarus translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Estate su Icaro\"\nThe Overloaded Man translated by Stefano Torossi as \"Dalla veranda\"\nSaturn Rising translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Gli anelli di Saturno\"\nDeep End translated by Stefano Torossi as \"L'ultima pozzanghera\"\nInto the Comet translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Seguendo la cometa\"\nChronopolis translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Cronopoli\"\nDepartment p. 140-168" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4472 ;
    rdamo:P30363 per:5902 ;
