    rdamd:P30137 "Passport to Eternity was translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Essi ci guardano dalle torri\".\nEscapement, The Thousand Dreams of Stellavista, The Cage of Sand and Passport to Eternity from the original collection are published in Urania #399. A mix-up in the Italian titles occurred between Thirteen to Centaurus - \"Tredici verso Centauro\" and Escapement - \"Il tempo si guasta\"\nDepartment p. 136-144" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
