    rdamd:P30137 "Passport to Eternity was translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Passaporto per l'eternità\".\nThe Watch-Towers, The Man on the 99th Floor, Thirteen to Centaurus, Track 12 and A Question of Re-Entry from the original collection are published in Urania #371. A mix-up in the Italian titles occurred between Thirteen to Centaurus - \"Tredici verso Centauro\" and Escapement - \"Il tempo si guasta\"\nSomebody to Play With was translated by Mario Galli as \"Qualcuno con cui giocare\"\nDepartment p. 104-112" ;
