    rdamd:P30137 "\"The Garden of Time\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Il giardino del tempo\"\n\"The 15th Wind of March\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Il quindicesimo vento di marzo\"\n\"Gil Braltar\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Gil Braltar\"\n\"Napoleon's Skullcap\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Il cappello di Napoleone\"\n\"The Scarecrow of Tomorrow\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Lo spaventapasseri del futuro\"\nHave Space Suit... Will Travel was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Ho la tuta: viaggerò nello spazio\"\n\"What Price Wings\" was translated (by an uncredited translator) as \"Accidenti alle ali\"" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
