    rdamd:P30117 "edited by Carlo Fruttero ; Franco Lucentini" ;
    rdamd:P30176 "Mondadori" ;
    rdamd:P30011 "1968-02-25" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "168 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "482" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"Il primo libro delle metamorfosi\" is an original Italian anthology. Contains:\nPlanet of Fakers translated by Giovanna Boselli as \"Il pianeta dei finti\"\nA Bowl Bigger Than Earth translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Mordi il prossimo tuo\"\nThe Blonde from Space translated by Maria Benedetta De Castiglione as \"Bionde dallo spazio\"\nCall Me Adam translated by Bianca Russo as \"Il professor Ameba\"\nVenus Smiles translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Le sculture di Vermillion Sands\"\nThe Night Before translated by Bianca Russo as \"L'ultima notte\"" ;
