    rdamd:P30004 "487" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "\"Gli scultori di nuvole\" is an original Italian collection. Contains:\nThe Cloud Sculptors of Coral-D translated by Luigi Cozzi as \"Gli scultori di nuvole\"\nThe Reptile Enclosure translated by Hilja Brinis as \"La spiaggia\"\nThe Delta at Sunset translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Il delta al tramonto\"\nTime of Passage translated by Hilja Brinis as \"Controtempo\"\nThe Impossible Man translated by Hilja Brinis as \"L'uomo impossibile\"\nThe Last World of Mr. Goddard translated by Mario Galli as \"Il piccolo mondo del signor Goddard\"\nMinus One translated by Mario Galli as \"Paziente perduto\"\nThe Space Twins translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Gemelli spaziali\"" ;
