    rdamd:P30137 "35th anniversary edition.\nPublication date not available, no publication date notes whatsoever on the copyright page.\n4th printing (from number line).\nCover art credited on back cover.\nInterior art illustrations credited on title page.\nPage numbers given in this pub record match those listed in the pub's TOC. Usually this includes a story's introduction, except for the two stories by David R. Bunch, for which there is only a single introduction." ;
