    rdamd:P30137 "WorldCat ID 1045923469 is for all the issues of the magazine.\nFarmer's story original title is reported as \"Deep Are the Grooves\".\nGabella's poems are contained in a section titled Nuovi frammenti dalla \"Antologia di Moon Creek\" (as a small collection).\nSmilby's interior art not credited but signed; it was credited in Gamma, #25 but not published there.\nThe TOC mentions interior art by Toninelli, which is not present." ;
