    rdamd:P30137 "Retains the ISBN of the Flamingo edition.\n1st printing of the Harper Perennial UK 2008 edition.\nThis publication has a numerically separate page section at the rear titled \"P.S.\" which contains an interview and an essay. Pages listed in brackets in the Contents below are in fact paginated, but bracketed here to separate them from the earlier contents of the book: they appear after the novel, not before.\n'Ballard's Worlds' first appeared as 'J G Ballard' in Martin Amis's Visiting Mrs Nabokov and Other Excursions, 1993.\nCover design by David Wardle, as credited to designedbydavid.co.uk." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:25722 ;
    rdamo:P30139 exp:3570 {| entedit:valueOrder 0 |},
        exp:1463089 {| entedit:valueOrder 1 |} .

