    rdamd:P30137 "\"Fifth printing, 1998\" stated on the copyright page.\nThe copyright page contains the complete Library of Congress Cataloging in Publication Data including the LCCN: 73-87699, omitting the year of publication and ISBN.\n\"Originally published in 1974 by Farrar, Straus and Giroux\" (over) \"This edition first published in 1994 by The Noonday Press, a division of Farrar, Straus and Giroux\" stated on the copyright page. This is the only mention of The Noonday Press in this printing. The title page and back cover give the publisher as Farrar, Straus and Giroux and the spine prints their logo above \"FSG\".\n\"Cover design © 1994 by Michael Ian Kaye and Melissa Hayden\" printed on the back flap of the dustjacket." ;
