    rdamd:P30014 "95" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First edition of this selection (\"Deutsche Erstausgabe\" is stated on the title page and on the back), the second part of \"The Road to Science Fiction 3\".\nTranslated by diverse hands.\nThe copyright is assigned for the the year 1979 to James Gunn.\nThe copyright of the translations is assigned for the year 1990 to the publisher.\nEditor on behalf of Heyne: Wolfgang Jeschke.\nApparent first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 1990\" is stated on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Media #72 (May 1990).\nThe table of contents is printed on pp. 5-8.\nThe last page of the final shortfiction (p. 379) is unnumbered.\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design is credited to Atelier Ingrid Schütz." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
