    rdamd:P30137 "First edition of this selection (\"Deutsche Erstausgabe\" is stated on the title page and on the back, \"Deutsche Erstausgabe 4/2001\" is stated on the copyright page).\nIt is the second part of \"The Road to Science Fiction 5\".\nTranslations by diverse hands.\nThe copyright is assigned for the the year 1998 to James Gunn.\nThe copyright of most of the translations is assigned for the year 2001 to the publisher.\nEditor on behalf of Heyne: Wolfgang Jeschke.\nApparent first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 2/2001\" is stated on the copyright page.\nThe table of contents is printed on pages 5-8.\nThe last page of the final shortfiction (p. 508) is unnumbered.\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design is credited to Nele Schütz Design.\nOther prices: ÖS 182 (Austria), €12.50 (valid from 2002 on)." ;
