    rdamd:P30137 "Completely revised reissue (\"Vollständig überarbeitete Neuausgabe\") stated on title page.\nFirst printing of this edition (stated on back as separate barcode and number \"01\" next to ISBN barcode).\nStories translated by Wolfgang Eisermann, Charlotte Franke, Alfred Scholz and Michael Walter. Translations revised by Angela Herrmann and Hannes Riffel.\nContains a full-page print of the small cover image on page [1].\n\"Gesammelte Erzählungen in zwei Bänden\" printed on title page (collected stories in two volumes).\nEditor: Sascha Mamczak.\nMonth and day of publication date not printed in book but taken from amazon.de (as of 2014-09-27).\n\"Billennium\" spelt that way at the beginning of the story, but \"Billenium\" on page of contents.\nLast page not numbered." ;
