    rdamd:P30137 "\"First published in 1985 as The Best Fantasy Stories by arrangement with The Magazine of Fantasy and Science Fiction\"\n\"This revised edition published in 1991\", drops 14 stories from the previous edition\nNo number line or printing statement\nThere is no editor credited\n\"Cover illustration by Alan Baker\" on back cover, no visible signature on the artwork\nRecord had a $12.95 price, but there is no price on book and it is by an English publisher" ;
