    rdamd:P30011 "1977-02-27" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "168 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "717" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Low-flying Aircraft and Other Stories was translated by Maria Benedetta De Castiglione and Mario Galli as \"La civiltà del vento\". Single stories were translated as follow:\nThe Ultimate City as \"La civiltà del vento\"\nLow-flying Aircraft as \"Il pastore aereo\"\nThe Dead Astronaut as \"L'astronauta morto\"\nMy Dream of Flying to Wake Island as \"Il bombardiere del sogno\"\nThe Life and Death of God as \"Vita e morte di Dio\"\nThe Greatest TV Show on Earth as \"Il più grande show televisivo mai visto\"\nA Place and a Time to Die as \"Gli invasori\"\nThe Comsat Angels as \"Bambini prodigio\"\nThe Beach Murders from the original collection is missing.\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4472 ;
    rdamo:P30363 per:5902,
        per:2203 ;
