    rdamd:P30137 "The Disaster Area was translated as \"La zona del disastro\". Contains:\nStorm-bird, Storm-dreamer translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"Gli uccelli giganti\"\nThe Concentration City translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"Città di concentramento\"\nThe Subliminal Man translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"L'uomo subliminale\"\nNow Wakes the Sea translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"Il mare è vicino\"\nMinus One translated by Mario Galli as \"Paziente perduto\"\nMr. F. Is Mr. F. translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"Il sig. F. è il sig. F.\"\nZone of Terror translated by Stefano Torossi as \"Zona di terrore\"\nManhole 69 translated by Vittorio Curtoni as \"Cubicolo 69\"\nThe Impossible Man translated by Hilja Brinis as \"L'uomo impossibile\"\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
