    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (''Deutsche Erstveröffentlichung'' is stated on back cover).\nFirst printing (''Erste Auflage: November 1988'' is stated on copyright page).\nHalf of original anthology Afterlives\nTranslated by by diverse hands\nEditor: Reinhard Rohn.\nCover artist not credited, identified from parent cover art.\nContents on p. 5f.; individual shortfiction copyrights on p. 351.\nJack Gaughan designed the visual art for Ellison's story, including the chapter headings. There's more art by him but it needs to be dated first (may be published as early as the piece's first appearance in 1970, or later)." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:5719 ;
