    rdamd:P30004 "1169" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "The 1990 Annual World's Best SF was translated as \"Destinazione spazio 2\". Contains:\nAlphas translated by Marzia Iori as \"Alpha\"\nThe Magic Bullet translated by Gabriella Campioni as \"Il proiettile magico\"\nNorth of the Abyss translated by Paola Andreaus as \"Nord dell'abisso\"\nAbe Lincoln in McDonald's translated by A. G. Pagliaro as \"Abraham Lincoln da McDonald\"\nIn Translation translated by Daniela Rossi as \"I traduttori\"\nDeath Ship translated by A. G. Pagliaro as \"Nave della morte\"\nChip Runner translated by Antonio Bellomi as \"Chiprunner\"\nA Sleep and a Forgetting translated by Antonio Bellomi as \"Dormire... forse dimenticare\"\nNot Without Honor translated by Lydia Di Marco as \"Non senza onore\"\nDogwalker translated by Daniela Rossi as \"Dogwalker\"\nSurrender translated by Daniela Rossi as \"La resa\"\nWar Fever translated by Susanna Molinari as \"Febbre di guerra\"\nIllness in a Word was translated by Silvia Lalìa as \"Il morbo\"\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
