    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition.\nSecond printing (\"2. Auflage\" is stated on the copyright page).\n\"Printed in Germany 1963\" is stated the on copyright page (if this is not stated erroneously, the month of publication must have been after November of 1963; a date in early 1964 is also possible, though).\nTranslated by Charlotte Winheller.\nThe last page of the final item (p. 154) is not numbered.\nUmschlag (cover) by Heinrichs & Piloty is stated on copyright page.\nPrice is taken from Deutsche Nationalbibliothek." ;
