    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition and printing (not explicitly stated). Most likely abridged.\nTranslated by uncredited.\nThe publication date is deduced from the fortnightly publication schedule.\nPp. 61 - 63 have part 2 of a (serialised) story by an uncredited J. G. Ballard.\nThe cover art is not credited. Lonati is credited at rs-lonati.de.\nOther price: S 4 (Austria), L 140 (Italy), sfr 0.80 (Switzerland), NF 1.00 (France), lfr 9.50 (Luxemburg), DM 0.60 (special price for Berlin)." ;
