    rdamd:P30137 "Retains the ISBN of the Flamingo edition.\n9th printing of the Harper Perennial UK 2006 edition, no publication date specified.\nThis publication has a numerically separate page section at the rear titled \"P.S.\" which contains a short story and an interview. Pages listed in brackets in the Contents below are in fact paginated, but bracketed here to separate them from the earlier contents of the book: they appear after the novel, not before.\nAlso priced $17.95 in Canada.\nCover design by David Wardle, as credited to designedbydavid.co.uk." ;
