    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 0007221835" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Retains the ISBN of the 2006 Harper Perennial (UK) edition.\n4th printing of the 2008 Harper Perennial (UK) edition, no publication date specified.\nThis publication has a numerically separate page section at the rear titled \"P.S.\" which contains an interview and an essay. Pages listed in brackets in the Contents below are in fact paginated, but bracketed here to separate them from the earlier contents of the book.\nCover design by David Wardle, as credited to designedbydavid.co.uk." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
