    rdamd:P30011 "1986-10" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "289 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 3518378074",
        "OCLC/WorldCat 74775072",
        "DNB 861159659" ;
    rdamd:P30106 "Phantastische Bibliothek" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "185" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First edition of this selection (not stated).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1986 to the publisher.\nEditor on behalf of Suhrkamp: Franz Rottensteiner.\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 1307\".\nStated first printing (\"Erste Auflage 1983\" on the copyright page), there's also a corresponding number line.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Media #30 (November 1986).\nThe table of contents appears on p. 5.\nThe individual sources and copyrights for the pieces of shortfiction are listed on pp. 288 & 289, with p. 289 being unnumbered.\nA list of 'Phantastische Bibliothek' - sorted by author - is on pp. [290]-[297], a selection of Suhrkamp paperbacks is on pp. [298]-[303] (p. [304] is blank).\nCover artist credited on copyright page." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4361 ;
