    rdamd:P30176 "Mondadori" ;
    rdamd:P30011 "2001-03" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "362 p." ;
    rdamd:P30106 "Millemondi (quarterly)" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "29" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "The Fantasy Hall of Fame was translated as \"Nuove avventure nell'ignoto\". This publication includes only one half of the content in The Fantasy Hall of Fame; the other half was published in \"Avventure nell'ignoto\" August 2000. Contains:\nThat Hell-Bound Train translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Quel treno per l'inferno\"\nBazaar of the Bizarre translated by Giuseppe Lippi as \"Il bazaar del bizzarro\"\nCome Lady Death translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Venite, Lady Morte\"\nThe Drowned Giant translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Il gigante annegato\"\nNarrow Valley translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Valle stretta\"\nFaith of Our Fathers translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Fede dei nostri padri\"\nThe Ghost of a Model T translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Il fantasma di una modello T\"\nThe Demoness translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"La demone\"\nJeffty Is Five translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Jeffty ha cinque anni\"\nThe Detective of Dreams translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"L'indagatore dei sogni\"\nUnicorn Variation translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"La variante dell'unicorno\"\nBasileus translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Basileo\"\nThe Jaguar Hunter translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Il cacciatore di giaguari\"\nBuffalo Gals, Won't You Come Out Tonight translated by Riccardo Valla as \"Le ragazze bufalo\"\nBears Discover Fire translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"Gli orsi scoprono il fuoco\"\nTower of Babylon translated by Gaetano Luigi Staffilano as \"La torre di Babilonia\"\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4472 ;
