        "DNB 730171698" ;
    rdamd:P30106 "Heyne Science Fiction & Fantasy" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "3324" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Second German edition.\nCopyrights are assigned for 1968 to Scott Meredith Agency (New York) and for 1971 to Marion von Schröder Verlag.\nApparent first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 1973\" is stated on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Times #129.\nEditor: Günter M. Schelwokat.\nThe table of contents appears on p. 5.\nP. 126 is the last numbered page, but the last story ends on the following page.\nA note on and an uncredited photo of Ballard are on the back.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design is credited to Atelier Heinrichs on the copyright page." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:1127 ;
