    rdamd:P30137 "First edition ('Deutsche Erstveröffentlichung' stated on title page), first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 1984\" stated on copyright page.\nTranslated by Michael Windgassen, Rainer Schmidt, Joachim Körber, Anita Wied, and Andreas Decker.\nEditor on behalf of Heyne: Friedel Wahren.\nLast page (267) is unnumbered.\nCover artist is credited on copyright page.\nCover design (\"Umschlaggestaltung\") is credited to Atelier Ingrid Schütz on the copyright page.\nContents on pp. 5f.\nMonth from 'Science Fiction Times, Februar 1984'." ;
