    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 9780985762513",
        "OCLC/WorldCat 812509760" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Date from Amazon.com. UK price £9.95. Cover unattributed. Coverage of Ballard's career from 1967 to 1973, including his art exhibition and a BBC TV film on car culture, titled \"Crash!\". \"Advertiser's Announcements\" is a series of five altered advertisement photos from \"Ambit\", copyright from 1967 to 1971. \"Foreword to 'The Atrocity Exhibition'\" is copyright 1969 for the Danish edition, and 1974 for the French edition. \"Inner Landscape\" originally published in \"Friends\", no. 17. \"Krafft-Ebing Visits Dealey Plaza\" originally published in \"Evergreen Review\", vol. 17, no. 96, Spring 1973." ;
