    rdamd:P30137 "The Four-dimensional Nightmare was translated as \"Incubo a quattro dimensioni\". Contains:\n• The Voices of Time translated by Lidia Lax as \"Le voci del tempo\"\n• The Overloaded Man translated by Stefano Torossi as \"Dalla veranda\"\n• Thirteen to Centaurus translated by Hilia Brinis as \"In tredici verso Centauro\"\n• The Garden of Time translated by Lidia Lax as \"Il giardino del tempo\"\n• The Cage of Sand translated by Hilia Brinis as \"La prigione di sabbia\"\n• The Watch-Towers translated by Hilia Brinis as \"Essi ci guardano dalle torri\"\n• Chronopolis translated by Beata Della Frattina as \"Cronopoli\"\n• The Sound-Sweep translated by Lidia Lax as \"Lo spazzasuoni\"\nPrima Belladonna and Studio 5, The Stars from the original collection are missing, while The Overloaded Man and Thirteen to Centaurus have been added.\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com; catalog number from http://www.catalogovegetti.com" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4472 ;
