    rdamd:P30106 "Omnibus" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "• \"Quando crollano le metropoli\" is an original Italian anthology. Contains:\n• Street of Dream, Feet of Clay translated by Hilia Brinis as \"La città premurosa\"\n• The Last Hero translated by Maria Benedetta De Castiglione as \"L'ultimo eroe\"\n• To the Chicago Abyss translated by Antonangelo Pinna as \"L'abisso di Chicago\"\n• The Day They H-Bombed Los Angeles translated by Simonetta Cattozzo as \"H su Los Angeles\"\n• The Drowned World translated by Stefano Torossi as \"Deserto d'acqua\"\n• Damnation Alley translated by Mario Galli as \"La pista dell'orrore\"\nData from http://www.fantascienza.com\nCatalog number from http://www.catalogovegetti.com\nWorldcat gives 456 as page count." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
