    rdamd:P30137 "First edition of this selection (not stated).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1983 to the publisher.\nEditor on behalf of Suhrkamp: Franz Rottensteiner.\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 954\".\nSecond printing by number line.\nThe table of contents appears on page 5.\nThe individual sources and copyrights for the pieces of shortfiction are listed on pp. 416 & 417; notes on the authors appear on pp. 418 & 419.\nThe main authors of Phantastische Bibliothek (i. e. J. G. Ballard, Johanna & Günter Braun, Herbert W. Franke, Stanisław Lem, H. P. Lovecraft and Arkadi & Boris Strugatzki) have also special entries in the final essay; the last page of this essay (p. 428) is unnumbered.\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nBasic data from Deutsche Nationalbibliothek; contents and organization from the first printing." ;
