    rdamd:P30106 "Phantastische Bibliothek" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "103" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (not stated), the copyright for this edition is assigned for the year 1983 to the publisher.\nFirst printing (\"Erste Auflage 1983\" is stated on the copyright page).\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 924\".\nEditor: Franz Rottensteiner.\nThe table of contents is printed on p. 5f.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe copyrights of the translations are listed on p. [178].\nMinus eins is listed as title on p. 5, but it's Minus Eins on p. 80; to avoid an unnecessary variant title the title due to a later publication Minus eins is chosen in this case.\nMonth of publication from SF-Star, August 1983." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4361 ;
