    rdamd:P30137 "First edition (\"Original-Anthologie\" stated on the back), apparent first printing.\nCopyright assigned 1985 to the publisher.\nIndividual copyrights on p. 311.\nA few titles differ as stated in the table of contents (p. 5f.) from the beginning pages; most notably this is the case with Bryant's story, stated as 2.46593 in the TOC.\nThe items by Jansen are inserted on colour plates between pp. 160 & 161.\nCover artist credited on the copyright page.\nOther prices: f 9.15 (Netherlands), FF 25 (France), S 53 (Austria), L 6,800 (Italy).\nMonth of publication from 'Science Fiction Times, März 1985'." ;
