    rdamd:P30137 "First edition.\nFirst printing (\"Erste Auflage 1984\" on the copyright page).\nEditor on behalf of Suhrkamp: Franz Rottensteiner.\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 1068\".\nTable of contents on page 5.\nIndividual sources and copyrights on p. 442f.; notes on the authors appear on pp. 444-446.\nThe main authors of Phantastische Bibliothek have also special entries in the last essay; these are J. G. Ballard, Johanna & Günter Braun, Herbert W. Franke, Stanisław Lem, H. P. Lovecraft and Arkadi & Boris Strugatzki.\nCover artist credited on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from 'Science Fiction Times, Oktober 1984'." ;
