man:500709
    a rdac:C10007 ;
    rdaxd:P00018 "http://entedit.org/manifestation/500709",
        "https://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/pl.cgi?500709" ;
    rdfs:label "Pandora, Spring 2007 (Shayol, 2007)" ;
    rdamd:P30156 "Pandora, Spring 2007"@de ;
    rdamd:P30117 "edited by Hannes Riffel" ;
    rdamd:P30176 "Shayol" ;
    rdamd:P30011 "2007-03-01" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "256 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 9783926126696" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Publication date stated as \"Spring 2007\" (\"Frühjahr 2007\").\nMonth and day of Publication date from amazon.de as of 2015-01-31.\nTitle of story \"Zweite Person - Gegenwart\" misprinted as \"Erste Person - Gegenwart\" in list of contents.\nThe review records for the books by Tobias O. Meißner on pages 224-225 are one article using the books' series name \"Im Zeichen des Mammuts\" as title.\nThe review records for the Conan books on pages 228-229 are one article reviewing both books together. It uses the short forms \"Conan 1\" and \"Conan 2\" printed next to each other as the title for the review.\nThe review records starting with \"Anatomy of Wonder\" on page 249 up to the \"Gothic Literature\" reviews on page 251 are all combined into one article called \"Nachschlagewerke\" and are reviewed consecutively.\nAdam Robert's essay starting on page 160 published in column \"Interpretationen klassischer Science-Fiction, Folge 11\" (column name and counting continued from the magazine's predecessor \"Alien Contact\").\nJohn Clute's essay starting on page 192 published in column \"Gefährlich Ehrlich, Folge 13\" (column name and counting continued from the magazine's predecessor \"Alien Contact\").\nList of contributors with a very short bio of every contributor on pages 252-254." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:36991 ;
    rdamo:P30363 per:130756 ;
