    rdamd:P30106 "Heyne Science Fiction & Fantasy" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "4000" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First edition (not stated), apparent first printing.\nThere's no copyright statement for the anthology.\nIndividual copyrights and sources are listed at the end of each respective shortfiction item.\n\"Printed in Germany 1985\" is stated on the copyright page.\nEditor on behalf of Heyne: Wolfgang Jeschke.\nThe table of contents appears on pp. 5-14.\nThe back cover lists also Brian W. Aldiss and Philip K. Dick as contributors, though none of their works was published in this anthology.\nSee individual content titles for the respective translators.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design (\"Umschlaggestaltung\") credited to Atelier Ingrid Schütz on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from 'Science Fiction Times, Dezember 1984'." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:1127 ;
