    rdamd:P30137 "First german pb editon, apparent first printing.\nTranslated by Alfred Scholz.\nThis edition is stated as a licence of \"Marion von Schröder\", the copyright statemnt is for the year 1972.\n\"Printed in Germany 1974\" is stated on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Times #134.\nThe table of contents appears on p. 5.\nThe last page (p. 189) is unpaginated.\nMistakenly stated as a translation of the collection \"The Four-Dimensional Nightmare\".\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design (\"Umschlaggestaltung\") is credited to Atelier Heinrichs on the copyright page." ;
