    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 3924959021",
        "OCLC/WorldCat 74821439",
        "DNB 870403397" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Apparent first German edition (not stated, but \"Deutsche Erstausgabe\" is stated on the publisher's website).\nTranslated by Joachim Körber.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1973 to the author.\nThe copyright of this limited edition of 1000 numbered copies is assigned to the publisher.\nP. 5 has a note on the edition: a photo of the author is glued to p. 7 and is autographed by the author for the first 300 copies.\nThere was thus only one printing.\nMonth of publication from the letter accompanying the initial distribution.\nThe artist is credited on the copyright page, the cover art is also signed.\nThe cover design is credited to Allgrafia.\nThe pieces of interior art are each time followed by a blank page." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:30382 ;
    rdamo:P30139 exp:1968524 {| entedit:valueOrder 0 |},
        exp:2770171 {| entedit:valueOrder 1 |} .

