    rdamd:P30137 "Translated by Joachim Körber.\nFirst unabridged German edition (\"Erste ungekürzte deutsche Ausgabe\" is stated on the back).\nFirst printing of this edition (\"1. Auflage – März 2008\" is stated on the copyright page).\nThe cover artist is stated on the copyright page.\nList of chapters on page 5.\nSoftcover with inner front and back flips.\nThe price is valid for Germany." ;
