man:560553
    a rdac:C10007 ;
    rdaxd:P00018 "http://entedit.org/manifestation/560553",
        "https://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/pl.cgi?560553" ;
    rdfs:label "You and Science Fiction (National Textbook Co., 1994)" ;
    rdamd:P30156 "You and Science Fiction"@en ;
    rdamd:P30117 "edited by Bernard C. Hollister" ;
    rdamd:P30176 "National Textbook Co." ;
    rdamd:P30011 "1994" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "[7]+349 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 0844255475" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "No price given.\n\"1994 Printing\".\n3rd printing from number line.\nThe book is divided into 4 sections (\"Who Am I?\", \"How Do I Relate to Others?\", etc.) with a short essay introducing each. Each section is divided into subsections (\"Family\", \"Friends\", etc.) which contain an essay discussing the subject, an essay entitled \"Projections\" containing hypothetical future headlines, cartoons, questions, etc. for discussion, a short story, and an essay entitled \"Probings\" containing further questions for discussion. Only the stories indexed here.\n\"Rat Race\" is credited to Raymond E. Jones." ;
