    rdamd:P30137 "First edition (not stated).\nApparent first printing.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1985 to the publisher.\nThe table of contents appears on pp. 5 & 6.\nPp. 155-175 feature two bibliographies of Ballard's works: A. original book editions and B. german publications.\nIndividual copyrights and sources are listed on p. 176.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe price is not stated in or on the book; it can be found at Deutsche Nationalbibliothek." ;
