    rdfs:label "The Doors of Perception and Heaven and Hell (Vintage (UK))" ;
    rdamd:P30156 "The Doors of Perception and Heaven and Hell"@en ;
    rdamd:P30117 "Aldous Huxley" ;
    rdamd:P30176 "Vintage (UK)" ;
    rdamd:P30182 "xviii+123 p." ;
    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 9780099458203" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "- The Doors of Perception was first published in Great Britain in 1954 by Chatto & Windus.\n- Heaven and Hell was first published in Great Britain in 1956 by Chatto & Windus.\n- Published by Vintage 2004.\n- 16th printing per number line [16], undated.\n- On p. 52 there is a short Foreword (one paragraph) to Heaven and Hell signed \"A.H.\".\n- David Bradshaw's biographical essay is the same as in the Vintage editions of Brave New World, Brave New World Revisited and Island. Signed \"David Bradshaw / Worcester College, Oxford / 1993\" and copyrighted for 1994.\n- The Foreword by J.G. Ballard is also copyrighted for 1994." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:247 ;
