    rdamd:P30137 "First german edition (not stated).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1964 to the author.\nFirst printing (\"Erste Auflage 1983\" is stated on the copyright page).\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 896\".\nEditor: Franz Rottensteiner.\nThe table of contents is printed on p. 5f.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe copyrights of the translations are listed on p. [235].\nThe month of publication is stated in SF-Star, April 1983 & SF-Star, Juni/Juli 1983." ;
