    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (not stated), Translated by Michael Walter.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1982 to the publisher; there's no other assignment of copyright.\nApparent first printing.\nThe metamorphosis (of a man into an aeroplane) by Fuhr spans over pp. 1-12; it is accompanied (among other information & statements) by the table of contents on pp. 5-11.\nThe cover artist is credited in the copyright section on p. 12." ;
