    rdamd:P30137 "Apparent first edition of this omnibus.\nContents on p. 5.\nThe title page of Crash on p. 7 preceds the notes (Anmerkungen).\nThe cover image (\"Einbandabbildung\") is credited to AKG, Berlin.\nCover design by agilmedien.\nThe original title of Ballard's essay Einige Anmerkungen zu CRASH is not stated but it is very likely a translation of Some Words About Crash!.\n\"Printed in Czech Republic 2004\", publication month from amazon.de.\nPrice from dnb.de (Deutsche Nationalbibliothek)." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
