    rdamd:P30137 "Some of the contained stories have never appeared in English before, some are re-translations (in cases where an existing translation was more than 25-30 years old or where the editors thought the existing translation had some flaws) and some use existing translations.\nDay of publication from Amazon.com as of 2016-06-02.\nFirst printing with full number line\nCanada price C$34.00\nEach story is preceded by an introductory essay.\ndata per amazon.com" ;
