    rdamd:P30137 "First edition of this omnibus.\nFirst printing: \"Erste Auflage 1999\".\nThe ISBN was also previously used in 1972 for Hermann Hesse's \"Das Glasperlenspiel\".\nCollects seven paperbacks in a slipcase that each were issued with new cover art & design (the cover photo for the Strugatsky title is a still from the movie 'Stalker'):\nDas Katastrophengebiet (see cover)\nBesuch von Drüben (see cover)\nRobotermärchen (see cover)\nTarget (see cover)\nDer Elfenbeinturm (see cover)\nPicknick am Wegesrand (see cover)\nDer Fall Charles Dexter Ward (see cover)\nSee this image for the organisation inside the slipcase.\nThe DM price at the time of publication is unknown, the publisher's catalogue from 2005 has a price of €5.95." ;
