    rdamd:P30137 "Sirius #43 ← Sirius #44 → Sirius #45\nTheme for this issue is named \"6X mali velik SF\" (6X a little big SF) with six short stories from non English authors, (p. 38-69)\nIn the editor's note of Sirius #46 is mentioned that the story \"Put bez kraja\" was plagiarized from a short story \"Far Centaurus\" by A. E. van Vogt. Van Vogt's story was later published in Sirius, #67.\nEssay \"Nije za SIRIUS...\" Started on page 17 and continued on pages: 83, 93 and 113.\nCover artist is not credited\nUncredited artwork on back cover" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
