        "Open Library OL27263565M" ;
    rdamd:P30106 "Bastei Lübbe Science Fiction Bestseller" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "22029" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (\"Deutsche Erstveröffentlichung\" is stated on the back).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1973 to Thomas M. Disch.\nApparent first printing (on recycled paper).\nMonth of publication from S.F. Perry Rhodan Magazin 2/81.\nTranslations by diverse hands: a list is printed on the copyright page, but there's no indication for the individual items.\nThe original English list of sources & individual copyrights is printed on p. 5f.\nThere are numerous typographical errors in the book, including the table of contents on p. 7 (too many to list them, but Ballard is only spelled correctly in the ToC).\nThe last shortfiction ends on the unnumbered p. 368.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nOther prices: S 60 (Austria)." ;
