    rdamd:P30137 "• Identifiable as a BOMC edition by the lack of a price on the jacket and a blind-stamp on the back board [maple leaf]\n• Copyright page includes the CIP data, including the ISBN but no statements of edition, printing or a number line\n• Back cover has the same two 'blocks' as the trade edition: 10841645 [month/year/price] and the ISBN\n• Locus1 notes a QPBC edition in 1985 and the BOMC editions are usually concurrent\n• The only publisher data/logos/etc is for Simon & Schuster" ;
