    rdamd:P30137 "Stated first edition (\"Originalausgabe\" on the copyright page).\nTranslated by diverse hands.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1989 to the publisher.\nApparent first printing (\"Sammlung Luchterhand, Februar 1989\").\nText editor on behalf of Luchterhand: Wieland Eschenhagen.\nThe table of contents appears on p. 5.\nThe cover is credited on the copyright page.\nThe sources for the individual shortfictions are listed on p. 186f. (with p. 187 being unnumbered - on that page also a dedication is printed)." ;
