    rdamd:P30106 "Heyne Science Fiction & Fantasy" ;
    rdamd:P30014 "3158" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "This publication appears as a new edition, though it seems to reprint the existing text under the established catalogue no.\nTranslated by Gisela Stege.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1962 to the author.\nThe copyright of the translation is assigned for the year 1969 to the publisher.\nEditor: Wolfgang Jeschke.\nApparent first printing.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Times #s 144 & 145.\nThe last page of the novel (p. 155) is unnumbered.\nA note on and a photo of the author are featured on the back cover.\nThe cover artist is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design (\"Umschlaggestaltung\") is credited to Atelier Heinrichs." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:1127 ;
    rdamo:P30139 exp:2498320 .

