    rdamd:P30137 "Apparent first edition (not stated).\nTranslated by diverse hands, (see the individual titles).\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1985 to the publisher.\nApparent first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 1985\" is stated on the copyright page.\nMonth of publication from Science Fiction Times September/Oktober 1985.\nThe table of contents appears on pp. 5 & 6.\nThe cover photograph is credited to 'Bildagentur Mauritius/Nägele, Mittenwald'.\nThe cover design is credited to Atelier Ingrid Schütz.\nA list of sources (\"Quellenverzeichnis\") is printed on pages 379 and 380, with p. 380 being unnumbered.\nLast page [380] is not numbered.\nThe cover photograph is credited to Bildagentur Mauritius/Nägele, Mittenwald.\nThe cover design is credited to Atelier ingrid Schütz.\nThe price is stated on the back cover and on the spine (there as '780' - the publkication series no. also appears there)." ;
