    rdamd:P30137 "First edition (not stated).\nNo copyright is assigned for the anthology.\nA further piece of shortfiction to be commented by Gerd Maximovič was intended for inclusion by the Weigand, but the printing of the two additional items was declined by the publisher.\nApparent first printing.\n\"Printed in Germany 1990\" is stated on the copyright page.\nThe table of contents is on pp. 5 & 6.\nThe individual translators, sources and copyrights for the shortfiction pieces are listed on p. 125.\nThe cover is credited on the copyright page.\nThe price is not stated in or on the book, it was found at DNB." ;
