    rdamd:P30137 "The copyright is assigned for the year 1983 to the publisher.\nTranslated by diverse hands.\nThe two essays by Pringle are grouped under the joint heading \"Zwei Aspekte von J. G. Ballards Werk\".\n\"Suhrkamp Taschenbuch 931\".\nStated first printing (\"Erste Auflage 1983\").\nMonth of publication from SF-star, September 1983.\nThe page count begins on the first interior page.\nThe table of contents is printed on p. 5 (p. 6 is blank).\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nNotes on the authors begin on p. 225.\nThe last numbered page is p. 225, followed by one page of notes continuation, seven pages listing the volumes of 'Phantastische Bibliothek' by number, seven pages listing other Suhrkamp paperbacks, the blank inside backcover and the backcover." ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:4361 ;
    rdamo:P30363 per:10982 ;
