    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (\"Deutsche Erstveröffentlichung\" is stated on the back).\nTranslated by diverse hands.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1990 to Donald A. Wollheim.\nStated as a licensed edition of 1990.\nText editor: Michael Schönenbröcher.\nStated first printing (\"Erste Auflage: Juli 1990\").\nThe table of contents is printed on pp. 5 & 6.\nThe final piece of fiction ends on p. 377; the individual copyright assignments & translator credits are listed on pp. 379-381.\nThe cover art is credited on the copyright page.\nThe cover design is credited to Quadro Grafik.\nOther prices: S 76.50 (Austria), P 875 (Spain)." ;
