    rdamd:P30137 "New German edition, the first under this title.\nTranslated by Carl Weissner.\nThe copyright is assigned for the year 1970 to the author.\nThe copyright of this limited edition of 200 numbered copies is assigned to the publisher.\nThere was thus only one printing.\nMonth of publication from the letter accompanying the initial distribution.\nP. 5 has a note on the edition.\nThere's no table of contents.\nThe title pages for the respective pieces precede the beginning pages each time by two pages.\nThe last page of the final piece of shortfiction (p. 226) is unnumbered.\nThe cover is credited to Allgrafia." ;
