    rdamd:P30137 "Whole no. 17, though the issue is stated erroneously as to be no. 18.\nThe initial day of distribution was 1980-07-07, according to a note in the previous issue.\nThe copyright section appears at the bottom of p. 3, with the table of contents above it; additional editors are credited as follows: Manfred Knorr for special advice, Joachim Bulla for the competition (\"Preisrätsel\"), Günter M. Schelwokat as text editor (\"Lektorat\"), Walter A. Fuchs (\"Clubmagazin\"), Hermann Urbanek and Alfred Vejchar (\"Sci-Fi-Media\").\n'Sci-Fi-Media' spans over pages 35-47, encompassing movie & publishing news as well as the book review section; 'Club-Magazin' spans over pages 53-57.\nThe extra pages are notated here with Roman numerals.\nThe serial instalment is inserted after p. 32 in the middle of the magazine (paginated 1-8).\nThe second 'Lichtträger' illustration actually takes pp. 32 & 33.\nP. 64 is an ad page.\nThere are some more pieces of interior art, but their artists are unidentifiable (not credited, not signed), and therefore not indexed.\nThe cover art is credited in the table of contents.\nSFPRM #16←SFPRM #17→SFPRM #18" ;
    rdamo:P30001 rdact:1049 ;
    rdamo:P30002 rdamt:1007 ;
    rdamo:P30420 pbl:25729 ;
    rdamo:P30363 per:280579 ;
