    rdamd:P30004 "ISBN 9991803211",
        "OCLC/WorldCat 474603082" ;
    rdamd:P30137 "Verification copy purchased from a Faroese bookshop for DKK 200 in September 2024. Faroese notice of publication in 2003 https://www.in.fo/news-detail/v-sind-skaldahami had the same price.\nHawthorne \"The Birthmark\" 1943; Wells \"The Country of the Blind\" 1904; Forster \"The Celestial Omnibus\" 1911; Bradbury \"The Wind\" 1943, \"The Scythe\" 1943, \"Kaleidoscope\" 1949, \"The Veldt\" 1950; Borges \"Parábola del palacio\" 1960; Singer \"Jachid and Jechidah\" 1961; Ballard \"The Garden of Time\" 1962, \"Now Wakes the Sea\" 1912, \"The Lost Leonardo\" 1964; Greene \"A Discovery in the Woods\" 1963; Shaw \"Light of Other Days\" 1966; Le Guin \"The New Atlantis\" 1975." ;
