    rdamd:P30137 "First German edition (Originalausgabe) (on title page and back cover).\nCopyright of the German edition 2000 is assigned to the publisher.\nCopyright for the individual texts and copyright of the German translations are stated at the end of each text (on copyright page).\nStated 2nd printing (on copyright page).\nPrinting history: Original edition published 5/2000.\nPrinted in Germany 6/2000 (on copyright page.\nCover artist is credited on the copyright page (using an image of a region with columns of dust masses in the gas nebula M 16 by the Hubble telescope).\nCover design is credited to Nele Schütz Design (per copyright page).\nOther price on back cover: ÖS 110,00 (Austria).\nLabelled »Science Fiction« (on spine, title page, back cover).\nEditor: Wolfgang Jeschke." ;
